2 :=\n    mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hc (sq_nonneg xc)\n  unfold ModeCoefficients.value\n  rw [h1, h2, h3]\n  unfold coefPairValue at hm\n  linarith\n\nend CellCalculus\n\nend CertCell\n\nend Breakdown\n"}